        <mxCell id="supply-prevention" value="Prevention:&#xa;✅ Run npm audit / pip audit regularly&#xa;✅ Use Dependabot or Snyk for monitoring&#xa;✅ Pin dependency versions&#xa;✅ Review third-party code before using&#xa;✅ Use Software Bill of Materials (SBOM)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
